+/*
+ * In-process checked initialisation.
+ *
+ * qemu_init() reports a fatal configuration error by calling exit()/abort() or
+ * by handing &error_fatal to a helper. That is correct for a standalone
+ * qemu-system binary but terminates the whole HOST process when QEMU is linked
+ * as an in-process library.
+ *
