+ * configuration error is detected, writing a diagnostic into *fail. It uses no
+ * setjmp/longjmp: every converted fatal path returns normally, so no stack
+ * frame is skipped and no cleanup is bypassed. Callers that need the upstream
+ * behaviour must keep using qemu_init().
