+ * VirtualWorld dev-only QOM path-resolution audit (VW_TRACE_QOM).
+ *
+ * fw_cfg_find() resolves TYPE_FW_CFG from the QOM root.  An intermittent
+ * crash (SIGSEGV in object_resolve_partial_path, reproducible with
+ * MallocScribble) means a child property still points at an object that was
+ * already finalized by an earlier failed-init teardown.  This check reports the
+ * first such dangling child property (owner type/name/property/pointer) and
+ * aborts with a structured message instead of dereferencing poisoned memory.
+ */
