+/*
+ * VirtualWorld dev-only QOM tree consistency walk (called by the lifecycle
+ * harness after each teardown; env VW_VALIDATE_QOM).  Recursively walks child
+ * properties from the QOM root and reports the FIRST property whose target
+ * object is no longer live in the in-process object registry, i.e. a dangling
+ * child property left by an earlier teardown (the class of corruption that
+ * crashes object_resolve_partial_path()/fw_cfg_find()).  It never dereferences
+ * a dead object.
+ */
