+/*
+ * VirtualWorld: structured fatal-error sink (see
+ * include/system/inprocess-fatal.h).
+ *
+ * Armed only while a checked in-process qemu_init() runs.  While armed, a
+ * fatal `error_fatal` / `error_abort` is recorded here and the caller returns
+ * to its normal unwind path instead of the host process being killed.  When the
+ * trap is not armed both sentinels keep their exact upstream behaviour.
+ *
